<title>USA: Federal-Mogul names Thomas Ryan as CFO.</title>
<headline>Federal-Mogul names Thomas Ryan as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTHFIELD, Mich. 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Federal-Mogul Corp said Friday it named Thomas Ryan as senior vice president and chief financial officer, replacing Thomas VanHimbergen, who left the company to pursue other opportunities.</p>
<p>Ryan has been employed by Tenneco Automotive, a division of Tenneco Inc, since 1995 as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Federal-Mogul manufactures and distributes a range of non-discretionary parts primarily for automobiles, trucks and farm and construction vehicles.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
